    "the constraint solver is not bit-deterministic: two rollouts from an identical restored state diverge within a few steps, so the planner searches an approximate model",
    "the planner is given the reward the learned policies are scored on, including the standing gate that zeroes every locomotion term below the band",
    "one environment, no vectorisation: the planning budget below is what a single CPU core affords, not what MJPC or a GPU batch would cost"
  ]
